# ============================================
# Submission Header Checks
# Clean headers from authenticated users
# ============================================

# Remove headers that reveal client information
/^X-Originating-IP:/        IGNORE
/^X-Mailer:/                IGNORE
/^User-Agent:/              IGNORE
/^X-Enigmail:/              IGNORE

# Replace Received header to hide client IP
/^Received: from .*\(.*\[.*\]\).*by/    REPLACE Received: from authenticated-user